{{#> layout title="Report fly-tipping"}}
<section>
  <h2>Report fly-tipping</h2>
  <p>Street Sorted is a prototype for reporting fly-tipping in your area.</p>
  <p>
    Use it to report an issue, check whether a nearby report already matches it, and add details when
    a new report is needed.
  </p>
  <h3>How it works</h3>
  <ol>
    <li>Tell us where the issue is.</li>
    <li>Check whether a nearby report already matches it.</li>
    <li>Add a description if a new report is needed.</li>
  </ol>
  <h3>Before you start</h3>
  <p>You will be asked for the issue location and a description of what you found.</p>
  <p>This prototype is not a live council service and does not guarantee a response.</p>
  <p><a class="primary-action" href="/report">Start a new report</a></p>
</section>
{{/layout}}
